# transformerlens-fdr

Statistical Audit Add-on for TransformerLens.

Wraps around standard `TransformerLens` activation patching workflows and enforces statistical auditing.

Prevents false-positive circuit discoveries by:
1. Running activation patching across model components.
2. Subtracting baseline control noise.
3. Applying Benjamini-Hochberg False Discovery Rate (FDR) adjustments.
4. Computing the Circuit Localization Index (CLI).
